MODULE main_v2

FUNCTION create application
    locate and load configuration
    derive contained paths
    detect operating system and CPU architecture
    require a supported platform
    create the timed HTTP client, clock, and standard streams
    return the application record

FUNCTION main
    create the application and run the command line
    catch unexpected failures at the outer boundary
    print a diagnostic and return non-zero for any failure
    return zero only when the requested task succeeds
